            "state": "translated",
            "value": "專注時段內封鎖會令人分心的 App 和網站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Block macOS's own iPhone Mirroring the moment it opens and start Android screen mirroring instead — useful if you have no iPhone and it's just a Dock entry that goes nowhere. Only blocks it while a phone is actually connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Block macOS's own iPhone Mirroring the moment it opens and start Android screen mirroring instead — useful if you have no iPhone and it's just a Dock entry that goes nowhere. Only blocks it while a phone is actually connected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 內建的 iPhone 鏡像輸出一開啟，就將其阻擋並改為啟動 Android 螢幕鏡像。適合沒有 iPhone、Dock 中該入口無法派上用場的情況。僅在實際連接手機時阻擋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Block photos, videos, or screen captures from unlocking Face ID.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
