            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持喚醒的螢幕開闔角度觸發條件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caffeinate turns on by itself while any of these is true, and off again when none is. Switching caffeinate off yourself pauses them until the condition ends.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Caffeinate turns on by itself while any of these is true, and off again when none is. Switching caffeinate off yourself pauses them until the condition ends."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符合以下任一條件時，保持喚醒會自動開啟；所有條件都不符合時則自動關閉。手動關閉保持喚醒會暫停這些觸發條件，直到目前條件結束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
