    "Cursor, Antigravity, Devin, VS Code and Zed keep their agent in the editor process, so activity there is inferred from how hard it is working. Turn this off if idle typing registers as a running agent.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cursor, Antigravity, Devin, VS Code and Zed keep their agent in the editor process, so activity there is inferred from how hard it is working. Turn this off if idle typing registers as a running agent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cursor、Antigravity、Devin、VS Code 和 Zed 的代理程式在編輯器程序內執行，因此會根據其工作負載推斷活動狀態。若一般打字被誤判為執行中的代理程式，請關閉此選項。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
