    "Due to changes on macOS 27 charge limiting may not work for some users. If a limit is set, Sapphire will fallback to adapter mode (which cuts power from the adapter) when the limit is reach in order to enforce it. This method is under beta and may not always work, especially when the device is asleep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Due to changes on macOS 27 charge limiting may not work for some users. If a limit is set, Sapphire will fallback to adapter mode (which cuts power from the adapter) when the limit is reach in order to enforce it. This method is under beta and may not always work, especially when the device is asleep."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由於 macOS 27 的變更，部分使用者的充電限制可能無法生效。如果設定了上限，Sapphire 會在達到上限時改用電源轉接器模式，切斷轉接器供電以執行限制。此方式仍處於測試階段，可能並非一律有效，尤其是在裝置睡眠時。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
