    "Free on iPhone and Android. Drop files onto Sapphire to send them to the phone; received files land in Downloads. A Continuity Live Activity tracks progress in the notch. Local Wi-Fi is fastest, with Bluetooth fallback up to 32 MB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free on iPhone and Android. Drop files onto Sapphire to send them to the phone; received files land in Downloads. A Continuity Live Activity tracks progress in the notch. Local Wi-Fi is fastest, with Bluetooth fallback up to 32 MB."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 與 Android 上皆可免費使用。將檔案拖放到 Sapphire 即可傳送至手機；收到的檔案會儲存到「下載項目」檔案夾。Continuity 即時動態會在瀏海區域顯示進度。本機 Wi-Fi 速度最快，也可改用藍牙傳輸，最高支援 32 MB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
