    "Lower catches quieter work but may misread a busy editor as a running agent. Higher only reports sustained activity. Command-line tools that only exist while they run are unaffected.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lower catches quieter work but may misread a busy editor as a running agent. Higher only reports sustained activity. Command-line tools that only exist while they run are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "較低的值能偵測到較輕微的工作，但可能會將忙碌的編輯器誤判為執行中的代理程式。較高的值只會回報持續的活動。僅在執行期間存在的命令列工具不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
