    "Prevent wear by stopping charging at a lower level. 80% is recommended.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prevent wear by stopping charging at a lower level. 80% is recommended."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在較低電量時停止充電以減少耗損。建議設為 80%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prevents battery wear from constant micro-charging cycles when plugged in for long periods. Charging will pause at the limit and only resume when the battery drops by a set amount.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prevents battery wear from constant micro-charging cycles when plugged in for long periods. Charging will pause at the limit and only resume when the battery drops by a set amount."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防止長時間接上電源時，因頻繁的微量充電循環造成電池耗損。充電會在達到上限時暫停，並僅在電量下降設定的幅度後才恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prevents your Mac from sitting at 100% charge overnight, which can degrade the battery over time. Charging resumes on wake.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prevents your Mac from sitting at 100% charge overnight, which can degrade the battery over time. Charging resumes on wake."
