          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire automatically uses Apple's standard Clock shortcut names (\"Start Timer\", \"Start Stopwatch\", etc.). If iCloud sync is enabled and those Clock shortcuts are present on this Mac, they run automatically during sessions.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire automatically uses Apple's standard Clock shortcut names (\"Start Timer\", \"Start Stopwatch\", etc.). If iCloud sync is enabled and those Clock shortcuts are present on this Mac, they run automatically during sessions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 會自動使用 Apple 標準的「時鐘」捷徑名稱（「Start Timer」、「Start Stopwatch」等）。若已啟用 iCloud 同步，且這台 Mac 上有這些「時鐘」捷徑，則會在專注時段期間自動執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire does not permanently delete items that are already in Trash. Review or empty Trash in Finder.": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic presentation at literal source; reconcile with final compiler extraction.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire does not permanently delete items that are already in Trash. Review or empty Trash in Finder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 不會永久刪除已在垃圾桶中的項目。請在 Finder 中檢查或清空垃圾桶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire hides items with macOS's own menu bar controls only when it is installed in the Applications folder. This copy runs from elsewhere, so it falls back to stretching the divider up to the app menus.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire hides items with macOS's own menu bar controls only when it is installed in the Applications folder. This copy runs from elsewhere, so it falls back to stretching the divider up to the app menus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 只有安裝在「應用程式」檔案夾中，才能使用 macOS 內建的選單列控制來隱藏項目。目前的副本從其他位置執行，因此會改為將分隔線延伸至 App 選單處。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire is a Connect controller only, audio always plays on the Spotify desktop app or another speaker.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire is a Connect controller only, audio always plays on the Spotify desktop app or another speaker."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 僅作為 Connect 控制器，音訊一律由 Spotify 桌面 App 或其他揚聲器播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire is not a Spotify speaker. Choose the desktop app or another device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire is not a Spotify speaker. Choose the desktop app or another device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 不是 Spotify 揚聲器。請選擇桌面 App 或其他裝置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire is running through an application symlink. Move the real app into Applications before updating.": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic presentation at literal source; reconcile with final compiler extraction.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire is running through an application symlink. Move the real app into Applications before updating."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 正透過應用程式符號連結執行。請先將實際的 App 移到「應用程式」檔案夾再更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire isn't in a user-writable location. Install or repair the privileged helper, then use the standard install method.": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic presentation at literal source; reconcile with final compiler extraction.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire isn't in a user-writable location. Install or repair the privileged helper, then use the standard install method."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 不在使用者可寫入的位置。請安裝或修復特權輔助服務，然後使用標準安裝方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire lost connection to its system helper.\n\nClick “Reset Helper” to unregister Sapphire’s own background items, reinstall the helper, and relaunch. Other apps are not affected.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire lost connection to its system helper.\n\nClick “Reset Helper” to unregister Sapphire’s own background items, reinstall the helper, and relaunch. Other apps are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 與系統輔助服務的連線已中斷。\n\n按一下「重置輔助服務」可取消註冊 Sapphire 自己的背景項目、重新安裝輔助服務並重新啟動。其他 App 不受影響。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire needs a few permissions for its core features.": {
      "comment": "User-facing Sapphire interface text. Keep product names and interpolated user content unchanged.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire needs a few permissions for its core features."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 的核心功能需要一些權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire needs a privileged helper for battery management and system integrations. macOS will ask you to allow it under Login Items → Background Activity.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire needs a privileged helper for battery management and system integrations. macOS will ask you to allow it under Login Items → Background Activity."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 需要特權輔助服務來進行電池管理和系統整合。macOS 會要求你在「登入項目」→「背景活動」中允許。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire never permanently deletes Trash contents; review and empty Trash in Finder when ready": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic presentation at literal source; reconcile with final compiler extraction.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire never permanently deletes Trash contents; review and empty Trash in Finder when ready"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 絕不會永久刪除垃圾桶內容；準備好時請在 Finder 中檢查並清空垃圾桶"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire refused to remove an unsafe path: %@": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic interpolated presentation; key and placeholder types verified against module-build-01 compiler output.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire refused to remove an unsafe path: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 拒絕移除不安全的路徑：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire uses MusicKit for Apple Music artwork, artist details, the queue and your library. No login is needed beyond Apple Music access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire uses MusicKit for Apple Music artwork, artist details, the queue and your library. No login is needed beyond Apple Music access."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 使用 MusicKit 取得 Apple Music 封面、藝人詳細資訊、待播清單與資料庫。除授予 Apple Music 存取權限外，無須另外登入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire watches your own processes — nothing is read from inside an app, no accessibility permission is used, and nothing leaves the Mac.\n\nTools that only exist while they run (xcodebuild, cargo, gradle, npm run build, a command you typed) are detected the moment they start. Tools that stay resident between turns (Claude, Codex, an editor's built-in agent, a Gradle daemon) are reported only while they are actually working, which is why sensitivity exists.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire watches your own processes — nothing is read from inside an app, no accessibility permission is used, and nothing leaves the Mac.\n\nTools that only exist while they run (xcodebuild, cargo, gradle, npm run build, a command you typed) are detected the moment they start. Tools that stay resident between turns (Claude, Codex, an editor's built-in agent, a Gradle daemon) are reported only while they are actually working, which is why sensitivity exists."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 只會監看你自己的程序，不會讀取 App 內部的任何內容、不使用輔助使用權限，也不會有任何資料離開這台 Mac。\n\n只在執行期間存在的工具（xcodebuild、cargo、gradle、npm run build、你輸入的指令）會在啟動時立即偵測到。在回合之間持續常駐的工具（Claude、Codex、編輯器內建的代理程式、Gradle 常駐程式）只有在實際運作時才會回報，這就是提供靈敏度設定的原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire's menu bar icons need Sapphire to be allowed under System Settings → Menu Bar → Allow in the Menu Bar. If the control item never appears, check that switch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
