    "Terminate a protected app the instant it tries to open and only open it after you authenticate. Off lets it open (covered by a shield) with biometrics running automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminate a protected app the instant it tries to open and only open it after you authenticate. Off lets it open (covered by a shield) with biometrics running automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "受保護的 App 一嘗試開啟就立即終止，僅在認證後才允許開啟。關閉此選項時，App 可在遮罩保護下開啟，並自動啟動生物辨識認證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terminate protected apps while the lock is active (prevents notification snooping).": {
