            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將信任的 Wi-Fi 網路作為位置。在其他網路上或無法取得網路名稱時，Face ID 不會啟動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use your own image or video on the desktop. A video plays behind your desktop icons and pauses whenever the desktop is covered. The lock screen shows it too unless it has its own wallpaper.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use your own image or video on the desktop. A video plays behind your desktop icons and pauses whenever the desktop is covered. The lock screen shows it too unless it has its own wallpaper."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在桌面上使用你自己的影像或影片。影片會在桌面圖像後方播放，並在桌面被遮住時暫停。鎖定畫面也會顯示它，除非鎖定畫面有自己的背景圖片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses about 150–180 MB more memory. Recognition starts about 0.3 s sooner on each unlock, and up to 2 s sooner when macOS has dropped its model cache (after a restart, update, or memory pressure). Released automatically if memory runs critically low.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses about 150–180 MB more memory. Recognition starts about 0.3 s sooner on each unlock, and up to 2 s sooner when macOS has dropped its model cache (after a restart, update, or memory pressure). Released automatically if memory runs critically low."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會多使用約 150–180 MB 記憶體。每次解鎖時，辨識約可提早 0.3 秒開始；當 macOS 已清除模型快取時（例如重新啟動、更新或記憶體壓力過高後），最多可提早 2 秒。記憶體嚴重不足時會自動釋放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses its own signed updater — Sapphire will open the app.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses its own signed updater — Sapphire will open the app."
