          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用其專屬的已簽署更新程式，Sapphire 將會打開該 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses less energy but may be slightly slower to react.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
