    "We are committed to your privacy. We DO NOT automatically collect, store, or transmit any personal or sensitive information. This includes, but is not limited to:\n• Your name, email, or other personal identifiers\n• Screen contents or keyboard input\n• Application data from other apps": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We are committed to your privacy. We DO NOT automatically collect, store, or transmit any personal or sensitive information. This includes, but is not limited to:\n• Your name, email, or other personal identifiers\n• Screen contents or keyboard input\n• Application data from other apps"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我們承諾保護你的隱私，不會自動收集、儲存或傳輸任何個人或敏感資訊，包括但不限於：\n• 姓名、電子郵件或其他個人識別資訊\n• 螢幕內容或鍵盤輸入\n• 其他 App 的資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We believe in transparency. Please review our data handling practices below.": {
      "comment": "User-facing Sapphire interface text. Keep product names and interpolated user content unchanged.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We believe in transparency. Please review our data handling practices below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我們重視透明度。請檢視下方的資料處理方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
