    "⌘V in Finder turns a copied image into a PNG file in the front folder.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘V in Finder turns a copied image into a PNG file in the front folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Finder 中按 ⌘V，會將拷貝的影像轉為最前方檔案夾中的 PNG 檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘X then ⌘V moves copied files instead of copying them, ⌘V pastes copied images as PNG files into the front Finder folder, and F2 renames the selected item.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘X then ⌘V moves copied files instead of copying them, ⌘V pastes copied images as PNG files into the front Finder folder, and F2 renames the selected item."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘X 再按 ⌘V 會搬移拷貝的檔案而非複製，⌘V 會將拷貝的影像以 PNG 檔案貼至最前方的 Finder 檔案夾，F2 會為所選項目重新命名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
